  "bio": "Immerse yourself in the delicate and artistic world of Adam's Tattoo Studio, a premier inking sanctuary nestled in the heart of Rouen, France. Specializing in fineline and floral designs, this studio doubles as an art gallery, providing a visually inspiring environment where resident artists such as @juwelia888, @la_fine_lame, @chap_artwork, and @tinkedrbell transform skin into exquisite canvases. Connect with us at atftattoostudio@gmail.com to embark on a bespoke tattoo journey – where elegance meets permanence.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Rouen, Normandy, France\n\n• atftattoostudio@gmail.com \n22 rue du champ des oiseaux \n @juweliatattoo \n @leremythe\n @morphee_tattoo\n @abstrea_ink\n @canaille___",
